        "t": "Binary is the last 'how the machine holds information' idea in the elementary spiral. Liberian classrooms can do it with fingers, lamps and paper cards. No lab is required. Grade 6 who can count 0–7 in three bits are ready to see why files have sizes and why digital means on-and-off, not 'on a phone'."
