        "k": "p",
        "t": "The class investigation is **“Three-bit numbers on fingers”**. We act the algorithm, write it, debug it in pairs, and only then — if a device is present — try it on a machine. The method below is the one the teacher models on the chalkboard and the pupils then run themselves."
